# k.words/shards/frequency-f: how frequent the 503 words with senses here that start with "f" are: the Zipf value in wordfreq's English list and its band (1 very common, Zipf >= 6; 2 common, >= 5; 3 familiar, >= 4; 4 uncommon, >= 3; 5 rare).
